task.claim:
For K-163, K-233, K-283, K-409 and K-571 (m, mu = 1 if a = 1 else -1, the
published n and h, and t, f, delta, lambda from nist.json): mu = +-1;
h = 3 - mu = #E(F_2); h*n = 2^m + 1 - V_m; t = V_m;
delta*(tau - 1) = tau^m - 1 and N(delta) = n; t^2 - 4*2^m = -7*f^2 with
f = |B| where tau^m = A + B*tau; and lambda^2 - mu*lambda + 2 = 0 (mod n).
Consequently N(1 - tau^m) = h*n and N(delta)*N(tau - 1) = h*n.
